 ## Abstract
 
-We report a three-regime structure in the isotone step of alpha-decay
-Q-values, ΔQ(Z,N) = Q_α(Z+2,N) − Q_α(Z,N), across the deformed
-actinide region (N > 128). Using 74 isotone steps derived from
